1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,260
One dream,

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:08,260
one wish If you want it,
gotta go over the top!

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,680
Setting sail and heading for the unknown.

4
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:33,380
Cutting through the
winds and waves as I go.

5
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,437
Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no!

6
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,837
Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.

7
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,417
It's all or nothing, no time to worry!

8
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,140
Do it later, right now I'm living free.

9
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:51,477
When your foes look like
they will overwhelm you?

10
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:56,460
It means your heart's saying
this is what you can't do.

11
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:59,557
Despite all that to run is not an option.

12
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:01,637
Once they're closed, I
feel the satisfaction.

13
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:03,937
You think I'm rude,
here's my appreciation.

14
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:07,040
When things are getting
tough, just gotta smile.

15
00:01:09,860 --> 00:01:12,317
If you are going on your way?

16
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,577
And you're looking for
a fresh, brand new day?

17
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:19,257
Then make sure your only
thought you have is Yes, I can!

18
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:22,077
As you're on your way?

19
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,357
Marks maps will be made.

20
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:27,197
Yes, with every step that you will take.

21
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:30,397
Just look at all you've been through.

22
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:32,137
Look ahead at new horizons.

23
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:33,977
In view shining brightly.

24
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:36,840
Oh, who knows what's waiting for you?

25
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:40,137
Dream living, that's the way!

26
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:42,157
Make like a hurricane.

27
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,100
Now, got to make your mark today!

28
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:50,977
One dream, one wish.

29
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:52,997
Your dreams don't run away.

30
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:55,937
Go for the knockout.

31
00:01:56,020 --> 00:01:58,080
Over the top!

32
00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:07,900
Well, answer my question.

33
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:10,454
This will be your only chance to do so.

34
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:12,520
Who exactly are you?

35
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:14,072
And what were you up to?

36
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:19,478
If you speak honestly, then we shall
reward you with a painless death.

37
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:24,617
Do think it over.

38
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:27,637
Your other option is agonizing torture.

39
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:28,580
Of course.

40
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:36,097
My name is Ushimitsu Koza.

41
00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:40,377
The flow of money through the
capital is of interest to me.

42
00:02:40,460 --> 00:02:41,700
My apologies.

43
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:48,300
Is that so?

44
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:50,937
Then I am to assume this
is a research mission

45
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:53,549
to determine the target
of your next heist.

46
00:02:54,740 --> 00:02:56,446
That's quite a clever answer.

47
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:59,020
But I know as well as you do.

48
00:02:59,380 --> 00:03:01,000
That's not your real name.

49
00:03:19,660 --> 00:03:20,960
I have you now.

50
00:03:21,940 --> 00:03:25,352
Seeing how you moved, I know
you're not an average geisha.

51
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:28,236
Ushimitsu Koza may be a famous thief,

52
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:33,017
but you should at least have the decency
to take responsibility for your own crimes.

53
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:38,041
Very bold, but he would not strike again
so soon after his last move in the capital.

54
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:43,837
I'm growing impatient.

55
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:45,937
I'll ask one more time!

56
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:48,537
Go on, tell us your business!

57
00:03:48,620 --> 00:03:53,577
Your silence has indicated
that you prefer to be tortured!

58
00:03:53,660 --> 00:03:55,760
Very well

59
00:04:02,820 --> 00:04:03,820
What's your hair?

60
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:22,570
Huh?

61
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:25,280
She's gone! What the?

62
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,060
Where did she go?

63
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:30,980
Too close.

64
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:33,560
Glad I used a Shadow Clone Jutsu.

65
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,940
This is Aurobi.

66
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:40,120
Honami. Shinobu. Bonkichi.

67
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:42,816
My apologies, but my cover was blown.

68
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:46,500
Find somewhere to hide! Yikes.

69
00:04:46,740 --> 00:04:48,020
That is not good.

70
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:51,087
I can't believe they
were able to thwart you.

71
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:53,937
There are some ninjas
on patrol. Be careful.

72
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:55,920
Probably about 11 or so.

73
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,040
Whoa, there are that many? Huh?

74
00:04:59,060 --> 00:05:00,060
Fukuro Cage.

75
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:02,902
That's the name of their leader.

76
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:06,417
They're part of a dangerous
group called the Oniwabanshu,

77
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:08,206
the best of the best in Wano.

78
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:11,689
I'm sure they're seeking
Orobi as we speak.

79
00:05:11,780 --> 00:05:13,740
We have to find her. Let's go.

80
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:17,260
Listen, tell us where you are.

81
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:20,220
Hey, you looking for something, Kashi?

82
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:22,010
That's right.

83
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,748
How'd you make it out here?

84
00:05:24,700 --> 00:05:26,720
Oh, goodness, do you need a hand?

85
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:32,256
Sorry, I had a bit too much to drink.

86
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:35,781
I need a piss so I can hit
some more of that sake.

87
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,220
She hung up.

88
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:47,100
We have to find her
ourselves in that case.

89
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,040
Hey, Brooke, did you hear?

90
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,306
Locate Robin and protect her.

91
00:05:51,540 --> 00:05:52,422
Loud and clear.

92
00:05:53,020 --> 00:05:55,300
I'll search for her now. Galick.

93
00:05:56,660 --> 00:06:01,120
I finally got to do something fun,
but I suppose it was too good to last.

94
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,760
A curse upon you!

95
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,540
Is she also a ninja?

96
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,740
Perhaps it was a projection.

97
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:14,940
It doesn't matter if
it's ninjutsu or sorcery.

98
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:17,139
Her original body should be nearby.

99
00:06:17,740 --> 00:06:18,570
Find her!

100
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,737
Lord Orochi is still having a banquet.

101
00:06:20,820 --> 00:06:23,660
He must not be troubled with this. Now go!

102
00:06:24,060 --> 00:06:25,825
Exterminate this meddling rat!

103
00:06:33,140 --> 00:06:35,360
Come on, let's go.

104
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,580
Drink up.

105
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,430
Easy.

106
00:06:38,513 --> 00:06:39,343
Slow down.

107
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:42,546
Everyone enjoying themselves?

108
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:48,585
Hey, it's Odobe, the new girl!

109
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:50,077
Where have you been all night?

110
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,360
Come sit with me!

111
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,740
As you wish.

112
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:56,760
A wise man hides a leaf in the forest.

113
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,840
There's no escaping now.

114
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:01,080
And I still have work to do.

115
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:05,445
Forgive me for neglecting you.

116
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,445
Would you like some more sake?

117
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:08,720
My lord?

118
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:13,670
Orobi?

119
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:16,633
I'll search for her until I'm exhausted.

120
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:17,590
Oh, wait.

121
00:07:17,780 --> 00:07:19,309
Should've said bone-tired.

122
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:33,057
Who is that what are you doing

123
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:37,920
over there where'd they go

124
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:43,540
Are you all looking for
something, gentlemen?

125
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:48,640
The castle is haunted!

126
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:49,976
This is a nightmare!

127
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:57,360
My, and you bring these
treasures to the island?

128
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:59,160
They sound rather lavish.

129
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,300
It's tradition.

130
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,327
Would you like to hear more?

131
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:06,697
Please ask me anything.

132
00:08:06,780 --> 00:08:10,260
I insist really I suppose
if it's all right.

133
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:14,137
I do wish to get more acquainted
with you my lord It sounds to

134
00:08:14,220 --> 00:08:17,867
me like you're interested in
becoming my consort or to be dear

135
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:25,437
Come on a sucky.

136
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:28,040
Oh, why must you be so cruel my lord?

137
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,360
Now now don't soap.

138
00:08:32,580 --> 00:08:34,557
There's plenty of me to go around kay.

139
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:38,060
You are too cute my darling
girl I can't help but wonder,

140
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:41,100
does Lord Orochi know
what she's really like?

141
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:44,020
For someone of her beauty,

142
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:47,769
I would wager the Shogun would
overlook just about anything.

143
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:48,830
Adorable!

144
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:55,920
Is there something the
matter, Orochi? It's nothing.

145
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:06,200
Here, my lord. Enjoy.

146
00:09:09,740 --> 00:09:13,916
When Komala Saki pours, the sake runs
deeper, straight down to my soul.

147
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:19,000
The Oden truly is
beautiful beyond measure.

148
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:21,880
Oh, how I wish I were the Shogun.

149
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:25,864
I will admit her hidden dark side
has me a bit terrified, though.

150
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:30,337
That woman would never give a
man like you the time of day.

151
00:09:30,420 --> 00:09:31,250
Tell him.

152
00:09:31,333 --> 00:09:34,057
Hey, she was trained in your
pleasure hall, wasn't she, boss?

153
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:36,697
You must have used a firm
hand to keep her in place.

154
00:09:36,780 --> 00:09:37,900
But that's a story.

155
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:42,831
It seems you've mistaken a
geisha for a pet dog, my friend.

156
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,332
People are like flowers.

157
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:47,277
You must become the fresh
water at their roots.

158
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:49,654
Otherwise, how are they to truly bloom?

159
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:52,280
You got me there, boss.

160
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:54,777
What's this about
summoning the Toby Rope to

161
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:57,117
do your bidding against
one measly Sabo cook,

162
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,030
huh?

163
00:09:58,113 --> 00:09:59,320
Your retribution is fierce.

164
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:02,177
As Yakuza, we take great
pride in our family.

165
00:10:02,260 --> 00:10:05,789
Once one shares the ritual cup,
they are protected for life.

166
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,110
Tell me,

167
00:10:07,380 --> 00:10:11,997
if your child came home beaten to a pulp,
would you not take action on their behalf?

168
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:15,217
That chivalrous spirit of yours
never fails to impress, boss.

169
00:10:15,300 --> 00:10:17,100
We see eye to eye, Kyoshiro.

170
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:23,420
One's enemy must be crushed
with an overwhelming force.

171
00:10:24,180 --> 00:10:26,886
Cripple them so they may
never face you again.

172
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:33,900
Spare your foes no mercy, even if
they're nothing but an old ghost.

173
00:10:37,780 --> 00:10:42,640
That beating your underlings, Toki,
isn't the only issue here, Kyoshiro.

174
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:48,708
We have strangers
sneaking into the capital.

175
00:10:48,820 --> 00:10:49,980
This is a big deal.

176
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:54,077
I've said it once and I'll say it again.

177
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:56,336
So listen carefully or pay the price.

178
00:10:57,100 --> 00:10:58,300
The time has come.

179
00:10:58,540 --> 00:11:01,460
It's the 20th anniversary
of Kozuki Odin's death.

180
00:11:01,820 --> 00:11:05,000
His wife Toki said their
revenge would come this year.

181
00:11:05,820 --> 00:11:09,060
The Kozuki legacy persists even now!

182
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:15,590
Ha!

183
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,252
You can't get enough of that ghost story.

184
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:20,957
But we've long since
buried the Kozuki clan.

185
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,460
Right, Komurasaki?

186
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,020
Let me remind you!

187
00:11:25,260 --> 00:11:27,520
Odin's retainers, the Akazaya Nine,

188
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:30,217
were frightfully powerful
and loyal as they come!

189
00:11:30,300 --> 00:11:34,217
Their leader, Kin'emon, is
brave and crafty as a fox too!

190
00:11:34,300 --> 00:11:38,535
They've undoubtedly returned to the
land of Wano as part of some scheme.

191
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,760
They'll come for my head soon.

192
00:11:45,620 --> 00:11:47,640
I can see their faces now.

193
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:58,078
They won't be satisfied till
they take their revenge.

194
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:05,537
We've wiped out so many Kozuki clan folks.

195
00:12:05,620 --> 00:12:07,777
There's no one left to
be afraid of anymore.

196
00:12:07,860 --> 00:12:10,507
The whole thing seems
kind of pathetic to me.

197
00:12:14,660 --> 00:12:16,957
Someone fought the Yokozuna and Kuri.

198
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:19,777
Then they had the nerve
to go after Jack's men!

199
00:12:19,860 --> 00:12:21,837
And Kaido himself had to step in.

200
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:24,377
Then there was that sober cook.

201
00:12:24,460 --> 00:12:27,840
And that Ronin at the gambling
hall defying the Yakuza?

202
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:38,435
What if they were all attacking
under Kinemon's orders?

203
00:12:44,540 --> 00:12:47,660
Foxfire Kin'emon and the Akazaya Samurai.

204
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:52,320
If they want to challenge
us, then I welcome it.

205
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:56,266
I'll send them right back to
their graves with a single stroke.

206
00:12:58,780 --> 00:12:59,610
Hehehehehehe!

207
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:04,260
Dependable is always good show!

208
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,280
I know Odin is dead.

209
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:08,700
He fell right before my hides.

210
00:13:08,980 --> 00:13:12,700
But his son, Lomonoski, is
still alive out there somewhere!

211
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,470
Hm?

212
00:13:14,900 --> 00:13:16,940
His body was never recovered!

213
00:13:17,220 --> 00:13:19,837
And that goes to several
of Odin's retainers too!

214
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:21,560
The Kozuki clan yet lives!

215
00:13:21,980 --> 00:13:25,627
As we speak, they're probably
out there gathering more allies!

216
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:27,870
What?!

217
00:13:27,953 --> 00:13:30,814
They'll take Kaido's head too
once they're done with me!

218
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,868
It's only a matter of
time before they come!

219
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:42,557
They're gonna take Kaido's head?!

220
00:13:42,640 --> 00:13:44,037
You gotta be kidding me!

221
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,649
I know the Shogun's a
chicken, but come on!

222
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,000
Keep it down!

223
00:13:49,060 --> 00:13:52,717
If he hears you talking like that,
it's your head that's gonna roll!

224
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:53,630
Okay, cool.

225
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:54,557
Take this one next.

226
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:55,470
Okay!

227
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:59,100
Hey, I'm Adam Saki! Yes,
sir. Be right there.

228
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:01,880
Get that to him, if you would. Okay!

229
00:14:02,460 --> 00:14:04,460
Don't make me tell you this again!

230
00:14:04,700 --> 00:14:06,347
We're in the final year now!

231
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:08,940
Toki's dying words made it quite clear!

232
00:14:09,420 --> 00:14:12,008
That means we'd be
foolish not to heed them!

233
00:14:12,860 --> 00:14:14,220
He's such a coward.

234
00:14:14,400 --> 00:14:15,280
Pathetic, huh?

235
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:17,020
It's just a poem.

236
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,560
Can't over it.

237
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:22,900
You are the moon unaware of the dawn.

238
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:26,080
Here we go again.

239
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:28,300
This really ruins the sake.

240
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:35,257
May your purpose be fulfilled and
cast nine shadows on the night

241
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:40,280
woven of 20 years and you shall
know the brilliance of the dawn.

242
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:43,862
Need I tell you what that means?

243
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:47,380
20 years from Toki's death
on a ghostly moonlit night,

244
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:50,840
nine samurai will appear
to settle their own grudge.

245
00:14:52,620 --> 00:14:53,980
They'll kill me.

246
00:14:54,640 --> 00:15:00,300
Then carry out his will, they'll open up
the land of Wano to the rest of the world!

247
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:13,419
Interesting that he takes
the prophecy so seriously.

248
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:17,856
Though it's no surprise that his
subordinates don't share his position.

249
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,320
Convenient for us.

250
00:15:22,580 --> 00:15:23,697
Shogun's lost yet.

251
00:15:23,780 --> 00:15:27,000
Oh, your enemies are long
dead, you delusional fool.

252
00:15:27,500 --> 00:15:29,500
Nobody has cared for years.

253
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:30,920
Oh, grow up.

254
00:15:31,060 --> 00:15:32,707
It's just an old fairy tale.

255
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:33,762
They can't win.

256
00:15:34,300 --> 00:15:36,320
Don't give those bastards an inch.

257
00:15:40,140 --> 00:15:41,360
Stay vigilant.

258
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:44,300
There are deadly enemies lying in wait.

259
00:15:53,780 --> 00:15:54,610
Who is that?

260
00:15:56,700 --> 00:15:58,700
You can't laugh at the Shogun.

261
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:00,134
He'll have you killed.

262
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:06,420
Who was that?

263
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:10,240
You'd better not be laughing at me!

264
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:14,400
Walter, go stop.

265
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:16,040
He's so serious!

266
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:19,140
But everyone thinks the
Shogun is a big bull!

267
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:22,360
Get that girl out of here!

268
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,277
Sorry you guys!

269
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:30,020
I can't stop!

270
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:31,697
Sounds like a child!

271
00:16:31,780 --> 00:16:33,417
It must be Oidon's assistant!

272
00:16:33,500 --> 00:16:34,600
Shut her up!

273
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:36,100
Hotako, please!

274
00:16:37,180 --> 00:16:38,780
I know! I know!

275
00:16:38,940 --> 00:16:39,999
I shouldn't laugh!

276
00:16:46,740 --> 00:16:48,740
You mock me?

277
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:52,460
Don't forget I rule this country!

278
00:16:59,700 --> 00:17:01,700
Shut that girl up!

279
00:17:05,860 --> 00:17:09,260
The grudge from 20 years past!

280
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:12,840
You think me a coward?

281
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:16,480
You think that I still fear Odin?

282
00:17:16,620 --> 00:17:18,000
You should fear me!

283
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:23,080
I win that battle long ago!

284
00:17:25,860 --> 00:17:26,690
Shogun!

285
00:17:26,773 --> 00:17:28,580
Odin fell to me!

286
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:31,280
Please, I thank you!

287
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:37,280
Leave her be!

288
00:17:39,420 --> 00:17:41,680
Oiron, what can she do?

289
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:44,492
Watch, she's probably scheming something.

290
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:49,140
My lord, the poor girl's just a child.

291
00:17:49,520 --> 00:17:52,280
Stay out of this, Komurasaki!

292
00:18:00,980 --> 00:18:03,680
My lord, please forgive her!

293
00:18:04,540 --> 00:18:07,080
Did you laugh at me you little rat?

294
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:09,780
You'll pay!

295
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:17,677
She doesn't mean to.

296
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:18,857
She can't help it.

297
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:20,117
Don't let him kill her.

298
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,837
It's far too late to stop him!

299
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:22,757
He'll kill us too.

300
00:18:22,840 --> 00:18:23,757
Give it up!

301
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:25,877
My lord I beg of you!

302
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:27,120
Have mercy!

303
00:18:28,220 --> 00:18:30,520
Shut your filthy mouth and listen to!

304
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:33,200
Don't laugh at me?

305
00:18:36,460 --> 00:18:38,060
How to go.

306
00:19:11,660 --> 00:19:16,940
Komurasaki, why would you
do such a thing to me?

307
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:18,710
Apologize!

308
00:19:18,793 --> 00:19:19,623
Bow your head!

309
00:19:20,100 --> 00:19:23,453
Get on your knees and grind
your forehead into the floor!

310
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:25,300
I'll do no such thing!

311
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:32,040
I won't grovel.

312
00:19:32,740 --> 00:19:34,320
I kneel before no one.

313
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:38,300
The audacity!

314
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,960
I will not give an inch, you hear me?

315
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:43,494
Not when I know that I am in the right.

316
00:19:45,340 --> 00:19:46,170
Why?

317
00:19:46,253 --> 00:19:47,649
You've thrown it all away.

318
00:19:48,900 --> 00:19:50,720
I'd made up my mind.

319
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:54,580
I was going to give you
the greatest honor of all.

320
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:56,980
You were to be my wife.

321
00:19:57,080 --> 00:19:59,597
If you want some docile
wife with no spine,

322
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:02,177
then please go ahead and

323
00:20:02,260 --> 00:20:07,177
cut me down I am the daughter

324
00:20:07,260 --> 00:20:11,920
of a samurai that's enough I
I refuse to live in disgrace.

325
00:20:16,540 --> 00:20:19,400
You've got some nerve, woman.

326
00:20:25,380 --> 00:20:29,420
You're nothing but a glorified whore!

327
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:39,640
And you don't know a
damn thing about Samurai!

328
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,860
What happened to him?

329
00:20:54,980 --> 00:20:56,860
The Shogun transformed.

330
00:20:59,420 --> 00:21:01,080
Gomorrah Saki!

331
00:21:12,260 --> 00:21:14,400
But it's such a pity!

332
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:20,320
I would hate to see beauty
such as yours go to waste,

333
00:21:20,700 --> 00:21:23,500
crushed to pieces in my powerful jaw!

334
00:21:24,220 --> 00:21:25,780
Thou to me!

335
00:21:26,940 --> 00:21:29,040
Apologize and plead for your life.

336
00:21:29,220 --> 00:21:31,514
Then I'll grant you a lighter sentence.

337
00:21:38,880 --> 00:21:41,180
It's a generous offer.

338
00:21:41,600 --> 00:21:43,157
What are you waiting for?

339
00:21:43,240 --> 00:21:45,720
Apologize from the bottom of your heart.

340
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:50,280
You should learn to let things go.

341
00:21:55,780 --> 00:21:58,280
They say whoever falls in love loses.

342
00:21:59,820 --> 00:22:00,680
What?

343
00:22:01,780 --> 00:22:03,240
I will not beg.

344
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:05,680
Not even for my life.

345
00:22:09,140 --> 00:22:11,560
Why is she provoking him?

346
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:12,920
Stop it!

347
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:13,980
Komurasaki!

348
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:16,340
How dare you!

349
00:22:28,360 --> 00:22:29,480
THREE INCOMING!

350
00:22:40,080 --> 00:22:41,340
My lord, why?

351
00:22:41,580 --> 00:22:43,580
What did we do to earn your wrath?

352
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:48,120
Arrogant wench!

353
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:04,280
Wait, you're the lady for the Sofa Show.

354
00:23:04,540 --> 00:23:05,660
Why are you here?

355
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:06,741
Never mind that.

356
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:09,078
I'm just glad that you weren't hurt.

357
00:23:09,220 --> 00:23:10,980
Where did that sorceress go?

358
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:12,720
She must be close.

359
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:18,744
Thought you could fool us, huh?

360
00:23:19,260 --> 00:23:22,260
You're not going anywhere,
you wicked little snoop.

361
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:23,597
Over here, everyone.

362
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:24,760
I found our prey.

363
00:23:25,780 --> 00:23:26,680
Someone help!

364
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:32,620
Have it your way, Komurasaki.

365
00:23:32,960 --> 00:23:37,620
If you won't submit, then I'll
crush you today personally.

366
00:23:55,780 --> 00:23:57,360
He-he-he-he-he!

367
00:24:09,900 --> 00:24:11,760
This is pandemonium!

368
00:24:26,840 --> 00:24:28,800
Any last words?

369
00:24:32,360 --> 00:24:34,200
Very well, then.

370
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:37,630
Daegoku!

371
00:24:38,420 --> 00:24:40,040
The Shogun's gone wild!

372
00:24:40,220 --> 00:24:41,697
Quick, use some ninja tricks!

373
00:24:41,780 --> 00:24:42,662
Save the Oiran!

374
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:44,980
The Shogun's the boss here.

375
00:24:45,260 --> 00:24:47,554
The man's free to do whatever he wants.

376
00:24:48,560 --> 00:24:50,900
Besides, we have our own problems.

377
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:52,580
More specifically, her.

378
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:54,837
Invaders must be dealt with swiftly.

379
00:24:54,920 --> 00:24:56,500
You mean the geisha?

380
00:25:06,820 --> 00:25:08,980
So is Oro be some kind of spy?

381
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:11,360
I should have known.

382
00:25:11,620 --> 00:25:15,267
I've never seen her before, but
I didn't think anything of it.

383
00:25:18,080 --> 00:25:19,840
You gotta help, lady!

384
00:25:20,280 --> 00:25:21,800
The Oro's gonna die!

385
00:25:22,260 --> 00:25:23,731
There's nothing I can do.

386
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:26,117
Saving you will prove difficult enough.

387
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:28,259
I'm in a fair bit of danger myself.

388
00:25:45,420 --> 00:25:46,880
Someone help me!

389
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:51,200
He'll curse us to death!

390
00:25:51,380 --> 00:25:53,498
What the hell's going on over there?

391
00:25:54,740 --> 00:25:58,620
U-Gene, Rai-Gene, what are
you two screaming about?

392
00:26:06,040 --> 00:26:08,860
It must be some sort of Yo-Kai.

393
00:26:09,020 --> 00:26:12,000
A giant skeleton, a Gashadokuro.

394
00:26:13,940 --> 00:26:16,420
A curse upon you.

395
00:26:20,340 --> 00:26:21,170
What?

396
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:25,560
It's a ghost!

397
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:28,720
She passed out.

398
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:31,640
A curse upon you!

399
00:26:35,860 --> 00:26:40,160
I'm pleased to see you're safe. That
I am. Thank you. That was close.

400
00:26:41,860 --> 00:26:43,860
Does this color look good on me?

401
00:26:44,120 --> 00:26:45,940
It's amazing and keep it up.

402
00:26:46,140 --> 00:26:48,081
Let's escape this place together.

403
00:26:49,800 --> 00:26:50,980
It can't be.

404
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:53,454
The sorceress and the ghost are allies.

405
00:26:53,680 --> 00:26:55,460
It's time for Mellow Fleur!

406
00:26:57,100 --> 00:26:58,800
Panhegan Testo Moon!

407
00:27:05,900 --> 00:27:07,020
Jazzy tricks!

408
00:27:07,180 --> 00:27:08,062
We'll stop you!

409
00:27:08,180 --> 00:27:09,010
Huh?

410
00:27:12,040 --> 00:27:13,220
It's over!

411
00:27:16,360 --> 00:27:17,740
It's a yokai!

412
00:27:18,080 --> 00:27:20,697
Shall I escort you to
the land of the dead?

413
00:27:20,780 --> 00:27:22,980
Come along, please.

414
00:27:28,360 --> 00:27:29,520
Go away!

415
00:27:38,120 --> 00:27:40,260
This has turned into a real mess.

416
00:27:40,820 --> 00:27:42,020
What should we do?

417
00:27:42,280 --> 00:27:44,880
Alas, there's not much
point in hiding now.

418
00:27:45,220 --> 00:27:46,857
Perhaps we can help them out.

419
00:27:46,940 --> 00:27:48,580
All right, let's go.

420
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:53,920
Who attacked us? A ninja?

421
00:27:57,600 --> 00:28:01,780
Do my ears deceive me, or did
that woman just call you Shinobu?

422
00:28:03,780 --> 00:28:05,580
So it's you, Highness!

423
00:28:07,020 --> 00:28:11,780
You're still alive, you bewitching
vixen, you seductress kunoichi!

424
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:28,420
Shinobu, the man-killer!

425
00:28:41,640 --> 00:28:43,111
Recognized me right away.

426
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:44,340
No, my mistake.

427
00:28:45,420 --> 00:28:46,700
She was much hotter.

428
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:47,960
I'll screw you!

429
00:28:50,780 --> 00:28:51,610
NINPO!

430
00:28:52,020 --> 00:28:53,373
Ball crusher technique!

431
00:28:53,540 --> 00:28:55,357
That's not much of a technique.

432
00:28:55,440 --> 00:28:57,417
Oh, no mistaking it.

433
00:28:57,500 --> 00:28:58,977
That's her signature attack.

434
00:28:59,060 --> 00:29:01,580
It's why they call her the Mad Killer.

435
00:29:02,380 --> 00:29:04,320
She does it that much?

436
00:29:04,520 --> 00:29:06,260
I-I can't move.

437
00:29:07,140 --> 00:29:07,970
NINPO!

438
00:29:08,300 --> 00:29:10,280
Coralysis Jutsu! Huh?

439
00:29:10,760 --> 00:29:12,020
You made that up!

440
00:29:12,180 --> 00:29:13,240
Let us depart.

441
00:29:13,580 --> 00:29:15,080
I shall lead the way.

442
00:29:16,160 --> 00:29:17,420
Sexy NINPO!

443
00:29:18,080 --> 00:29:18,940
Rot garden!

444
00:29:19,600 --> 00:29:20,430
Ha!

445
00:29:36,920 --> 00:29:39,457
What's with these ninjas
falling through the ceiling?

446
00:29:39,540 --> 00:29:40,540
That's Highness!

447
00:29:40,800 --> 00:29:42,271
But who are the Konoichi?

448
00:29:42,600 --> 00:29:44,320
The Banquet Hall is a mess!

449
00:29:44,420 --> 00:29:46,244
What the hell is going on here?

450
00:30:02,080 --> 00:30:03,760
Anami. Oh, hello.

451
00:30:04,940 --> 00:30:07,140
Shall I curse you too?

452
00:30:08,820 --> 00:30:10,160
No, thank you.

453
00:30:10,680 --> 00:30:11,510
Anami.

454
00:30:11,593 --> 00:30:13,168
I came here to back you up.

455
00:30:16,660 --> 00:30:20,240
Where did you go, Korosaki?

456
00:30:20,880 --> 00:30:23,240
There you are.

457
00:30:39,900 --> 00:30:41,020
Kyoshiro!

458
00:31:00,780 --> 00:31:03,940
You should not have done that, Komodosaki.

459
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:09,600
Prepared to die?

460
00:31:09,760 --> 00:31:10,840
I fear nothing.

461
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:41,340
I don't know.

462
00:31:58,900 --> 00:32:02,140
Oh, my God.

463
00:32:32,020 --> 00:32:32,937
No!

464
00:32:33,020 --> 00:32:34,480
How could he?

465
00:32:35,320 --> 00:32:36,640
She's dead!

466
00:32:43,280 --> 00:32:46,100
Sir Kyoshiro, why did you do such a thing?

467
00:32:47,380 --> 00:32:49,880
The most beautiful woman in all of Wano.

468
00:32:50,200 --> 00:32:51,400
It's a tragedy.

469
00:33:06,800 --> 00:33:07,630
Komurasaki.

470
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:17,180
What were you thinking, Kyoshiro?

471
00:33:19,400 --> 00:33:22,360
I didn't order you to kill her, damn it!

472
00:33:22,800 --> 00:33:24,160
How dare you!

473
00:33:29,740 --> 00:33:31,640
I granted her a mercy.

474
00:33:32,660 --> 00:33:36,060
That is to say, she had a samurai's death.

475
00:33:37,400 --> 00:33:41,760
No matter who is the offender,
no one rebels against the Shogun.

476
00:33:42,760 --> 00:33:44,580
The rules are absolute.

477
00:33:47,320 --> 00:33:50,140
Is the sub-twisted way
to show his loyalty?

478
00:33:50,520 --> 00:33:52,108
What does he need to prove?

479
00:33:52,320 --> 00:33:53,700
He's gone too far.

480
00:34:14,340 --> 00:34:16,680
Give me that child!

481
00:34:18,580 --> 00:34:20,520
I'm not done here!

482
00:34:23,840 --> 00:34:28,220
I will be satisfied
when I crush your bones!

483
00:34:31,120 --> 00:34:36,497
If you hadn't laughed at me,
Cobra Saki would still be alive!

484
00:34:36,580 --> 00:34:39,540
You rotten little feats!

485
00:34:40,760 --> 00:34:43,860
What the hell are you totting, Otterby?

486
00:34:44,420 --> 00:34:45,600
Pender over!

487
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:49,590
Otterby!

488
00:34:50,160 --> 00:34:51,400
He's him! Come out!

489
00:34:53,120 --> 00:34:54,980
Oh boy, oh boy!

490
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:56,967
You really wanted to see me?

491
00:34:57,140 --> 00:34:59,258
I bet you'd love a weather egg, huh?

492
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:00,340
You bet!

493
00:35:04,380 --> 00:35:06,457
A curse upon you.

494
00:35:06,540 --> 00:35:07,777
We have an intruder to deal with.

495
00:35:07,860 --> 00:35:09,577
There's no time to be running in terror!

496
00:35:09,660 --> 00:35:11,257
A curse upon you.

497
00:35:11,340 --> 00:35:13,477
He's not really attacking us though.

498
00:35:13,560 --> 00:35:16,200
A curse upon you. I say!

499
00:35:18,440 --> 00:35:20,177
I noticed. Uh-oh.

500
00:35:20,260 --> 00:35:22,960
I suppose I can excuse myself now. Oh, no!

501
00:35:24,180 --> 00:35:25,010
Hurry!

502
00:35:25,860 --> 00:35:26,690
Intruders!

503
00:35:26,773 --> 00:35:27,756
To the banquet room!

504
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:28,860
We must fight!

505
00:35:29,220 --> 00:35:30,960
Capture the wicked sorceress!

506
00:35:31,120 --> 00:35:32,580
Her ninja allies, too!

507
00:35:36,800 --> 00:35:39,700
Go forth and quell Lord Odorchi's rage!

508
00:35:50,260 --> 00:35:51,900
Watch the floor! Ready?

509
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:53,840
Neen-Po!

510
00:35:54,180 --> 00:35:55,840
Lightning plant!

511
00:36:02,440 --> 00:36:03,520
What the hell?

512
00:36:17,080 --> 00:36:20,357
The power of youth.

513
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:22,400
Your ninpo is wild but mighty.

514
00:36:22,680 --> 00:36:24,020
That was close!

515
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:25,240
Splendid work.

516
00:36:25,500 --> 00:36:26,420
You saved us.

517
00:36:35,720 --> 00:36:37,360
This is Oshiroko.

518
00:36:37,740 --> 00:36:39,400
Go ahead and try it, Olen.

519
00:36:43,980 --> 00:36:44,937
Oh, my.

520
00:36:45,020 --> 00:36:46,300
It smells lovely.

521
00:36:46,560 --> 00:36:48,120
I'm so hungry, too.

522
00:36:52,980 --> 00:36:53,810
Goodness!

523
00:36:53,893 --> 00:36:54,723
Heavenly!

524
00:36:55,520 --> 00:36:58,860
It's so sweet, I've never
had anything like it.

525
00:36:59,500 --> 00:37:00,500
Well, thank you.

526
00:37:00,660 --> 00:37:02,013
I'm pleased to hear it.

527
00:37:04,500 --> 00:37:07,420
But forgive me, I'm
afraid that's all we have.

528
00:37:07,720 --> 00:37:09,500
I wish I could eat it all day.

529
00:37:09,980 --> 00:37:12,437
But I know you shared
as much as you could.

530
00:37:12,520 --> 00:37:14,260
That means so much to me.

531
00:37:17,680 --> 00:37:21,660
She seems nice, but you said she's
strong and scary, too? Uh-huh.

532
00:37:22,160 --> 00:37:23,317
As strong as they come.

533
00:37:23,400 --> 00:37:25,377
Then we should ask her
to save Luffy Toto from

534
00:37:25,460 --> 00:37:28,620
the bad guys while she's
still being friendly. What?

535
00:37:29,760 --> 00:37:31,480
Oh, a fine idea.

